{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_CANTP_SECTION_7_1_2_Transmit_request","src":"manifest","doc":"SWS_CANTransportLayer","page":25,"text":"7.1.2 Transmit request\nThe transmit operation, CanTp_Transmit(), will allow upper layers to ask for data\ntransfer using CAN transport protocol facilities (segmentation, extended addressing\nformat and so on).\n[SWS_CanTp_00177] ⌈After the transmit request was accepted, the CanTp module\nshall notify its upper layer if the N-SDU transfer is fully processed (successfully or\nnot).⌋","caption":"7.1.2 Transmit request","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_CANTP_SECTION_7_1_2_Transmit_request","releases":["R23-11"],"page":25,"hash":"93cd4b0582193313","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_CANTP_SECTION_7_1_2_Transmit_request","releases":["R24-11"],"page":25,"hash":"d3005edcdf56134c","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_CANTP_SECTION_7_1_2_Transmit_request","releases":["R25-11"],"page":25,"hash":"a4bc47c84a114f23","caption":""}],"releases":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE","m":"","why":"Direktzitat [SWS_CanTp_00177] im Text von SWS_CANTransportLayer.","rel":["R25-11"],"id":"SWS_CanTp_00177"},{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"API_IMPLEMENTATION","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE (deterministic citation)","rel":["R23-11","R24-11","R25-11"],"id":"SWS_CanTp_00212"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.85,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"transmit request completion notification via PduR","rel":[],"id":"SWS_CanTp_00204"}],"ok":true,"schema":"versions-explorer@1"}